+  between iterates rather than the error, so it reports `1.6e-5` while the
+  answer is still 60% wrong;
+* **hydrodynamic** (`tau_N << tau_R`): normal scattering conserves momentum,
+  so the drift moment is damped by only `1 - tau_C/tau_R = 1 - 1e-3`, at
+  every wavelength.
+
