+iteration, no change to the sweep, the discretisation or the fixed point --
+preconditioned by a synthetic acceleration built from the *same* discrete
+operator projected onto polynomials of low degree in `(cx, cy)`.  Degree 1 is
+textbook diffusion synthetic acceleration; degree 2 is bought automatically
+when `tau_C/tau_N` says the drift mode is the slow one, and the solve
+escalates on its own if that guess was wrong.  Ten to thirty sweeps covers
+every case in `cases/`, and the residual GMRES drives to zero is the true
+residual of the transport system, not a preconditioned surrogate.
